# Line endings
#
# Everything Git detects as text is stored LF and checked out LF, on Windows
# too. eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf=true, which is what was rewriting files
# to CRLF on checkout and then warning about converting them back on the way
# in. Nothing in this repo needs CRLF: no .bat or .cmd files, and Python,
# Node and PowerShell all read LF fine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# SVG is XML: normalize it like any other text file so it stays diffable.
*.svg text eol=lf

# Binary: no line-ending conversion, no diff, no merge.
*.png binary
*.parquet binary
*.npy binary
